You may have the environmental variable NOAWT set (see: Sys.getenv("NOAWT") ). That is when I get this error. Try unsetting it and restarting JGR. The error is cryptic, and could be better.  Or given that JGR ignores NOAWT, iplots could ignore NOAWT when run from JGR.

Ian


