Message-ID: <14DD9E44-9395-4473-8974-66C169E5047F@stat.ucla.edu>

JGR() downloads the launcher and starts it from a script which takes care non-standard library/R locations. You can see them in your working directory. Please try the following and let me know if it works.

Sys.setenv(NOAWT=1)
library(JGR)
Sys.unsetenv("NOAWT")
