We can't really provide detailed advice since you didn't provide the code used. From experience, there is a good chance that you failed to load the required packages or some other initialization issue that you take for granted in interactive R.

In general, it is a good idea to run Rserve in debug mode (use Rserve(TRUE) in R) and check the error output. Also it may help to use try(..., silent=TRUE) constructs to catch errors (see Rserve FAQ).

